Package: rootspeak
Version: @VERSION@-@REL@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Nicola Fiorillo <rootspeak@nicfio.it>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libsystemd0, systemd, sudo, procps
Recommends: zenity
Suggests: libnotify-bin
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://rootspeak.nicfio.it/
Description: @SUMMARY@
 RootSpeak - Advanced Messaging System for Linux. The administrators of a
 Linux machine send messages to its users, in every terminal and on the
 desktop, and see for each user whether the message was delivered and
 confirmed. Administrators use the rspeak command; users get the messages
 automatically.
 .
 Free of charge, source available: see /usr/share/doc/rootspeak/copyright.
